{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0184hFahY25BBfGZYJK7Vtqd","type":"tool_result","content":"113:lights: 2 (your own), spots: 0 (flashlights), glowLights: 4, shadows, outlines, filter, camera: { mode, proj, fov, chase, ... }, terrain (an open\n192:  call: turn your own camera), near, far (units) }; camera.target also sizes the outlines and centres the sun's shadow\n243:  world.look = 'card' | 'puppet'; world.res = 'pixels' | 'balanced' | 'full'; world.shadows; world.outlines\n444:/* outlines: an inverted hull. The same (instanced) mesh again, back faces only, each vertex pushed OUTLINE_PX pixels\n1104: * 4. PARTS DRAWN BY CODE  instanced batches of four shapes (tube, ball, box, cone) in a toon look with outlines, and\n1159:  end(outlines) {\n1163:    if (this.shell) this.shell.count = outlines ? this.n : 0;\n1406:    outlines(on) { for (const K of kinds.values()) K.shell.visible = on; }\n1587:    end(outlines, thick = 1) {\n1594:          if (outlines) { for (const [dx, dy] of OFFS) go.drawImage(pg.cv, 0, 0, P, hNow, dx, dy, P, hNow); go.globalCompositeOperation = 'source-in'; go.fillStyle = OUTLINE; go.fillRect(0, 0, P, hNow + t); go.globalCompositeOperation = 'source-over'; }\n2228:     *  'full'; outlines: an outline round characters and things; gravity: units a second squared (480: the 2D slimes'\n2231:    this.outlines = o.outlines !== false; this.gravity = o.gravity ?? 480; this.shadows = o.shadows ?? (st.shadows3d !== false);\n2945:    this.atlas.end(this.outlines, cam.cv.thick);\n2946:    for (const b of Object.values(this.B)) b.end(this.outlines);\n2947:    if (OB) for (const b of Object.values(OB)) b.end(this.outlines);\n2948:    this._shapeKit.outlines(this.outlines);","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"afaa845e-3b4d-4028-b42c-2fc9910c5b5f","uuid":"b62b0d89-2a7a-44d1-bfe0-6964a09e6c07","timestamp":"2026-11-04T08:41:35.735Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"113:lights: 2 (your own), spots: 0 (flash