ven didn\\'t.', area: '01C' },\n  { name: 'HIMMELSBAHN — HOLD ON TIGHT', line: 'I held on. The lift let go.', area: '01D' },\n  { name: '1926 TEAM — EIGHT FOR GOLD', line: 'Eight on the lift. Seven on the wall. One in the bed.', area: '01E' }\n];\n\nS7.DOSSIER = {\n  t00: { title: 'TARGET 00 — AUGUSTIN GRAU', tab: 'targets', text: 'Bell captain, Grand Hotel Nada. Forty-one years of service. Never late. Never smiled.\\n\\nSmiling since Tuesday.' },\n  t01: { title: 'TARGET 01 — HANSI PULVER', tab: 'targets', text: 'Three Olympic golds. The face of Nada chocolate. Instructor to presidents.\\n\\nListed by the Department: WARM FRONT — COMMANDER.' },\n  graufile: { title: 'Grau\\'s employee file', tab: 'documents', text: 'Hired 1984. Promoted 1991. Commended for discretion eleven times.\\n\\nNotes: carries guests\\' luggage without asking what is inside. Recommended.' },\n  roomservice: { title: 'Room service: the Bellcaptain\\'s specials', tab: 'documents', text: 'Turn-down service. Wake-up call. Late checkout.\\n\\nEarly checkout. Very early. Ask at the desk.' },\n  accord: { title: 'The Thaw Accord, Article Nine', tab: 'documents', text: 'The Free Canton of Piz Nada shall open the Glacier Archive. Every account. Every name.\\n\\nEvery body. In trust.' },\n  avalanche1926: { title: 'The Avalanche of 1926', tab: 'documents', text: 'A clipping. A chairlift of eight young skiers, the national team, caught on the Black Run. One survivor, a girl of four... no. Of fourteen.\\n\\nThe photograph shows eight. Count again.' },\n  standingorders: { title: 'Department of Discretion: Standing Orders', tab: 'documents', text: '1. Discretion.\\n2. See 1.' },\n  pricelist: { title: 'The ski school price list', tab: 'documents', text: 'Group lesson: 40.\\nPrivate lesson: 80.\\nPrivate lesson, no questions: 800.' },\n  exposure1: { title: 'Exposure: the blackboard', tab: 'exposures', text: 'Under a cartoon of a chairlift, in invisible ink:\\n\\nTHE DAY THE EIGHT WENT UP: 26 · 01' },\n  exposure2: { title: 'Exposure: the ledger', tab: 'exposures', text: 'ACCOUNT 7 — HOLDER: H. HOLLE\\nCONTENTS: SEVEN (7) PERSONS, DECEASED 26.1.1926\\n— IN TRUST.' },\n  hansiShot: { title: 'Note: the interview (shot)', tab: 'targets', text: 'He talked. You listened. Then you didn\\'t.\\n\\nThe chairlift kept swinging.' },\n  hansiFell: { title: 'Note: the interview (fell)', tab: 'targets', text: 'You hesitated. He noticed.\\n\\nHe let go of the chair. The fog took the rest.' }\n};\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01PSjRmoVEJRHMQWsobhw1Jj","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
